WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:03.000
Paradise Audio. 17 free plug-ins for Logic Pro.

00:03.150 --> 00:08.100
Engine 909. Twelve drum voices, all synthesised.

00:08.150 --> 00:12.535
Sixteenths, thirty-seconds. House, trap, drum and bass.

00:12.585 --> 00:14.994
Then drag the groove straight into Logic.

00:15.144 --> 00:22.994
The Compressor's duck pumps on the beat. Halves, quarters, eighths, sixteenths.

00:23.144 --> 00:26.494
Voice Box. Eight vocal effects, one rack.

00:26.494 --> 00:28.094
[A real voice, dry]

00:28.094 --> 00:32.194
[Autotune, harmony and reverb from Voice Box]

00:32.294 --> 00:36.490
Seventeen plug-ins for Logic Pro. Free.
